=== self-test result ===
PASS  clean run passes every control
PASS  tile is free of a dark lattice where now is not
PASS  overlap's mid-fade rows are brighter than tile's
PASS  tile's fade stays on its ideal
PASS  a seamy tile is caught: its rows read dark
PASS  flattened colours in a fade are caught: pixels far off the ideal
PASS  the flat control's own failure is caught
PASS  a bright-row detector with nothing to detect fails its control
SELF-TEST OK
